# `project.active_project`

The active project and its workspace state.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.workspaces.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`WorkspaceActiveResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
